          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo akusatiji kuti ali ŵakalamuka nambo citamileco ali ŵakuloŵela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵalesile kumlambila Mlungu jwa cijumi jwangali mbesi, m'malo mwakwe ŵalambilaga yilandanyo yiyapanganyidwe kuti yiwoneceje mpela mundu jwele jwakusawaga kapena mpela yijuni ni yinyama yine, kapena yakwaŵa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.16+DEU.4.17+DEU.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 4:16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ni ligongo lyakwe Mlungu ŵalesile jemanjajo kuti atendeje yindu yakusakala yiyasakaga mitima jawo mpaka kutenda yindu yakutesya soni jwine ni mjakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵalesile yakuwona yisyesyene ya Mlungu m'malo mwakwe ni kukuyaga ya unami. Ŵatandite kulambila yindu yakupanganyidwa ni Mlungu m'malo mwakumtumicila Mlungu msyenejo, jwele jwali jwakwenela kumcimbicisya mpaka kalakala! Ami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa lyele ligongoli, Mlungu ŵalesile jemanjajo kuti atende yindu yakutesya soni yijasakaga mitima jawojo. Atamose acakongwe, ŵalesile kutenda yindu ya mu ulombela muyikusosekwela kuŵela mwiŵasa nambo m'malo mwakwe akukuya utende wine wakusisyana ni muyikwenela kuŵela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nombe nawo acalume, ŵalesile ndamo ja cipago jakwakumbila acakongwe, nambo m'malo mwakwe akukumbilana mnope acalumepe. Ŵatendaga yakutesya soni, myoyo ŵaliŵilacisye acimsyene cilango cakwaŵajilwa malinga ni yitendo yawo yakusakalayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti jemanjajo nganayitendela masengo ya kumpikanila Mlungu, Mlungujo ŵalesile jemanjajo mu nganisyo syawo syakusakalasyo, pakuti ŵatendaga yangasosekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'mitima mwawo mwagumbele ni yindu yangalumbana yejinji, mpela kusakala, mitulo ni lupuso. Akusagamba ganisya ya wiwu, yakuwulaga ŵandu, ya ndeu, yakulambusya ni ya lupuso. Akusanonyela misogodo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni kulambucisyana jwine ni mjakwe, nipo ŵakuŵengana ni Mlungu, ŵacipongwe, ŵakulikwesya soni ŵakusimbwa. Akusasosasosa matala gasambano gakutendela yakusakala soni ŵangapikanila acinangolo ŵawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ŵakuloŵela, ŵangakulupicika, ŵangali cinonyelo cakupagwa naco kapena canasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akusamanyilila Lilamusi lya Mlungu lyakuti ŵandu ŵakutenda yeleyi akuŵajilwa kuwa, nambo jemanjajo ŵakutenda yeleyowo, akusakamulana ni ŵandu ŵane ŵakusayitendaga yeleyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
